  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00449",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“命运啊……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, fate...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00449",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "打那以后，千重子就成了我家的孩子，已经过去二十年了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Since then, Chieko became our child, and twenty years have already passed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00449",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "究竟对你是好是坏呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I wonder whether that was good or bad for you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00449",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "就算好吧，我心里也是感到内疚，常常暗自祈求你原谅。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if it was good, I still feel guilty in my heart, and I often pray silently for your forgiveness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00449",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你爹大概也是这样吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Your father probably feels the same way too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
